  "description": "<p>Currently we are not validating RDF on rebuild.  A problem could arise if the internal RDF subject and object URIs do not conform to Fedora's expectations.  We will index the object but then choke when trying to access it.  </p>\n\n<p>To be defined:  the validation rules</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
